Package: SAGEE
Title: Species Archetype Generalized Estimating Equations
Version: 0.1
Date: 2027-06-01
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Francis K.C.",
                    family = "Hui", 
                    role = c("aut", "cre"), 
                    email = "fhui28@gmail.com"))
Maintainer: Francis KC Hui <fhui28@gmail.com>
Description: Fits a species archetype generalized estimating equation (SAGEE) model to a matrix of multivariate responses, hard-classifying species into a fixed number of archetypes where species assigned to the same archetype share a vector of archetypal regression coefficients. SAGEE only requires specification of a marginal mean model, a marginal variance function, along with a working correlation matrix describing spatial dependence among sites within each species. 
